    <!--
      Franchise screen in landscape: a shorter poster.

      Landscape is short and wide, so the poster's 2:3 height is the binding constraint on
      how much of the screen a row may take. Narrowing the poster is what keeps a landscape
      row from becoming a column of posters with a thin strip of text beside them, and it
      hands the width it gives up to the synopsis, which is what has the most to say.
    -->
    <dimen name="franchise_poster_width">108dp</dimen>
